# Genesis V2 infrastructure-as-code: never commit real Terraform/OpenTofu state or variable values
# (see infra/README.md rules 2-3) -- only *.tfvars.example with placeholder values may be committed.
infra/**/*.tfstate
infra/**/*.tfstate.*
infra/**/.terraform/
infra/**/*.tfvars
!infra/**/*.tfvars.example
